<section aria-labelledby="scdp-experiments-heading">
  <h2 id="scdp-experiments-heading">Real-World Manipulation</h2>
  <p>
    The following autonomous demonstrations use a single global-view RGB camera. They cover precise insertion, visual distractors, sequential
    manipulation, and different grasp geometries. Captions retain the playback speeds of the original demonstrations.
  </p>

  <h3>Precise Manipulation</h3>
  <p>
    USB insertion requires grasping the drive, aligning it with the hub port, and pushing it into place. Battery insertion additionally requires
    overcoming spring resistance to seat the battery in its slot.
  </p>
  <div class="research-content__videos">
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/USB_4x" caption="USB insertion: grasp, align, and insert the drive (4× speed)." %}
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Battery_2x" caption="Battery insertion: align the battery and push against spring resistance (2× speed)." %}
  </div>

  <h3>Robustness to Visual Distractors</h3>
  <p>The insertion tasks are repeated with additional objects in the workspace, testing whether the policy attends to the relevant interaction.</p>
  <div class="research-content__videos">
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/USB_Distractor_4x" caption="USB insertion with surrounding visual distractors (4× speed)." %}
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Battery_Distractor_2x" caption="Battery insertion with surrounding visual distractors (2× speed)." %}
  </div>

  <h3>Long-Horizon Manipulation</h3>
  <p>The drawer task links four stages: open the drawer, pick up a banana, place it inside, and close the drawer.</p>
  {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Long_Horizon_2x" caption="A four-stage drawer manipulation sequence (2× speed)." %}

  <h3>Cup Grasping and Cube Pushing</h3>
  <p>
    Further tasks require adapting a grasp to the cup handle, placing one finger inside a cup to grasp its wall without hitting the rim or handle, and
    pushing a target cube among distractors.
  </p>
  <div class="research-content__videos">
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Grasp_Cup_Handle_Ours_4x" caption="Grasping a cup by its handle across different handle orientations (4× speed)." %}
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Cup_Distractor_2x" caption="Grasping the cup handle among distracting objects (2× speed)." %}
    {% include research-project-video.liquid path="scdp/Cup_Wall_Grasping_4x" caption="Grasping the cup wall with one finger inside the cup (4× speed)." %}
